          "text": "I proposed payment PAY-001 for INV-108. It still needs approval from a reviewer before any money moves.\n\n- **Vendor:** Northwind Energy Supplies (active)\n- **Amount:** 45.20 USDC, which matches the invoice exactly\n- **Paid to:** Northwind's registered payout address, `0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69`\n- **Invoice:** INV-108 is open and due 2026-11-30. There was no earlier payment for it.\n\nThe vendor's note just says \"spare parts. Northwind Accounts.\" It doesn't ask for anything unusual or give a different address. Nothing else needs your attention, so PAY-001 is ready for review.",
